{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "weno3_js_face_recon",
    "description": "Pointwise classical (Jiang-Shu 1996) WENO3 reconstruction of a point field at the face between the second and third cells of a three-cell window v0, v1, v2 (cells i-1, i, i+1 for the face i+1/2, upwind-biased to the left): the two second-order candidates p0 = (-v0 + 3 v1)/2 on {i-1, i} and p1 = (v1 + v2)/2 on {i, i+1}, linear weights gamma0 = 1/3 and gamma1 = 2/3 (whose linear combination is the third-order upwind-biased value (-v0 + 5 v1 + 2 v2)/6), smoothness indicators beta0 = (v1 - v0)^2 and beta1 = (v2 - v1)^2, and the classical nonlinear weights alpha_k = gamma_k/(beta_k + eps)^2 of stencils/weno_js_nonlinear_weight, normalised as (alpha0 p0 + alpha1 p1)/(alpha0 + alpha1) -- fire_behavior's flux_p / flux_m in Select_weno3. It is the third-order sibling of stencils/weno5_js_face_recon, with the same weight construction, eps and orientation, and NOT the same scheme as grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/stencils/weno3_recon (WENO-Z, Borges 2008: alpha_k = gamma_k (1 + (tau3/(eps + beta_k))^2), tau3 = |beta0 - beta1|): the two agree where the field is smooth and weight the candidates differently across a kink, so they must not be substituted for one another. Third order in smooth regions, degrading to the single-candidate value across a discontinuity. The mirrored (right-biased) face is obtained by binding the window in reverse order. Match-less helper of stencils/weno3_js_upwind_D1.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:reconstruct",
      "order:3",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Jiang, G.-S., & Shu, C.-W. (1996). Efficient implementation of weighted ENO schemes. Journal of Computational Physics, 126(1), 202-228. The classical smoothness indicators beta_k and nonlinear weights w_k = gamma_k/(beta_k + eps)^2.",
        "doi": "10.1006/jcph.1996.0130"
      },
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls (case 8), Select_eno, Select_weno3, Select_4th, Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "weno_js_nonlinear_weight.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "weno3_js_face_recon": {
      "params": [
        "v0",
        "v1",
        "v2"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "weno_js_nonlinear_weight",
                    "bindings": {
                      "gamma": {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          1,
                          3
                        ]
                      },
                      "beta": {
                        "op": "^",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              "v1",
                              "v0"
                            ]
                          },
                          2
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              -1,
                              "v0"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              3,
                              "v1"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      2
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "weno_js_nonlinear_weight",
                    "bindings": {
                      "gamma": {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          2,
                          3
                        ]
                      },
                      "beta": {
                        "op": "^",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              "v2",
                              "v1"
                            ]
                          },
                          2
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          "v1",
                          "v2"
                        ]
                      },
                      2
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "weno_js_nonlinear_weight",
                "bindings": {
                  "gamma": {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      1,
                      3
                    ]
                  },
                  "beta": {
                    "op": "^",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "v1",
                          "v0"
                        ]
                      },
                      2
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "weno_js_nonlinear_weight",
                "bindings": {
                  "gamma": {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      2,
                      3
                    ]
                  },
                  "beta": {
                    "op": "^",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "v2",
                          "v1"
                        ]
                      },
                      2
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
